(* diyone7 -arch AArch64 -variant memtag -metadata false -oneloc ExcEnter EretNext PosRW Rfi *)
AArch64 CoRW1+pos-rfi-excenter-eretnext
Variant=memtag
{
 0:X0=x:green; uint64_t 0:X3=0;
}
 P0               | P0.F           ;
 L00: LDR W1,[X0] | ADD W2,W2,#1   ;
 MOV W4,#1        | MRS X3,ELR_EL1 ;
 STR W4,[X0]      | ADD X3,X3,#4   ;
                  | MSR ELR_EL1,X3 ;
                  | ERET           ;

exists (0:X2=1)
